WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.130 --> 00:00:02.130
What's up everybody!

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:03.130
We are Pongfinity

00:00:03.130 --> 00:00:05.960
And welcome to another episode of Challenge
Pongfinity

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:07.520
This is the series where YOU

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.520
challenge US

00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:09.920
With your craziest ideas

00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.020
related to table tennis.

00:00:11.020 --> 00:00:12.540
If your idea gets picked

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:13.929
We will give you a shout out

00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:15.420
And feature in our next video.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.340
So make sure you leave your comments and ideas

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:19.200
In the comment-section below!

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:24.700
Antion Diachuk is wondering if it's possible

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.480
To serve around the net.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.700
Let's find out.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.100
Since it wasn't possible to do it with a normal
table

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:35.400
We did have to add some length.

00:00:56.920 --> 00:00:59.640
Rohan Poddar wants me to play with a shuttle
cock

00:00:59.640 --> 00:01:00.960
instead of a racket.

00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:04.000
I think Miikka will have no chance against
me!

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.920
Raja Rapn wants us to do smashes on 2 tables.

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:03.940
Vijay Singhal wants to see us play with a
cloth hangar.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:43.040
Thanks for watching!

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:45.220
If you enjoyed this episode make sure to leave
it a thumbs up!

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.540
And if you are new to the channel subscribe
here!

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.800
And watch our other videos here.

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:51.600
Until next time!

